<%--
Api_Key_Created_Modal_Body - Success message for API key creation with copyable key

Modal body component that displays the newly created API key for the user to copy.
The full key is only shown this one time - it cannot be retrieved later.

Arguments:
- $name (string, required): The key name
- $api_key (string, required): The full plaintext API key
- $scopes (string|null): The key's canonical scopes; null means unrestricted
- $read_only (bool): Whether the key may execute GET requests only

Usage:
    <Api_Key_Created_Modal_Body $name="Production API" $api_key="rsx_live_abc123..." />

Layout:
- Warning about one-time display
- Key name display
- Copyable text input with copy button
- The key's scope: the word Unrestricted, or the canonical scopes verbatim

The scope is shown HERE and not only in the grid because this is the moment the operator
can still act on it - the key is immutable after mint, so a rule set that turned out wrong
means revoking this key and generating another.
--%>
<Define:Api_Key_Created_Modal_Body tag="div">
    <div class="mb-4">
        <div class="alert alert-warning d-flex align-items-start">
            <i class="bi bi-exclamation-triangle-fill me-2 mt-1"></i>
            <div>
                <strong>Important:</strong> Copy this key now. You won't be able to see it again!
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mb-3">
        <label class="form-label fw-bold">Key Name</label>
        <div class="text-muted"><%= this.args.name %></div>
    </div>

    <div class="mb-0">
        <label class="form-label fw-bold">API Key</label>
        <Textbox_Click_To_Copy $value="<%= this.args.api_key %>" />
        <small class="form-text text-muted d-block mt-2">
            Click the input or copy button to copy the API key to clipboard.
        </small>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-3">
        <label class="form-label fw-bold">Access</label>
        <% if (this.args.read_only) { %>
            <div class="text-muted">Read-only - this key may execute GET requests only.</div>
        <% } else { %>
            <div class="text-muted">Read + write - this key may GET and POST.</div>
        <% } %>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-3">
        <label class="form-label fw-bold">Scope</label>
        <% if (!this.args.scopes) { %>
            <div class="text-muted">Unrestricted - this key carries every permission your account has.</div>
        <% } else { %>
            <pre class="Api_Key_Created_Modal_Body__scopes"><%= this.args.scopes %></pre>
        <% } %>
    </div>
</Define:Api_Key_Created_Modal_Body>
